WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

2
00:04:25.219 --> 00:04:26.168
What's going on. Hop?

3
00:04:27.812 --> 00:04:30.146
You back again?

4
00:04:34.787 --> 00:04:35.714
Oh. sick!

5
00:04:36.707 --> 00:04:37.634
Find good one?

6
00:04:38.563 --> 00:04:40.124
Yeah. <i>Ten Tigers of Kwangtung.</i>

7
00:04:40.579 --> 00:04:41.528
This is gold.

8
00:04:44.291 --> 00:04:45.535
<i>Bride With White Hair.</i>

9
00:04:46.275 --> 00:04:47.617
Chinese. no subtitles.

10
00:04:47.683 --> 00:04:49.822
Hey. Hop. do you have
any early Shaw Brothers?

11
00:04:49.892 --> 00:04:51.102
There's a guy
who does Leopard style...

12
00:04:51.171 --> 00:04:53.342
Leopard style. Dragon style...

13
00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:57.187
fly through air. fight on water.

14
00:04:58.115 --> 00:05:01.149
Crouching Tiger.
Spanking Monkey.

15
00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:02.947
I know you.

16
00:05:03.011 --> 00:05:05.378
Another white boy
who wants to know kung-fu.

17
00:05:06.147 --> 00:05:07.260
Kick the ass.

18
00:05:08.323 --> 00:05:09.436
Get the girls.

19
00:05:53.379 --> 00:05:55.135
Only storage back here.

20
00:05:56.836 --> 00:05:57.883
Where did you get this?

21
00:05:58.563 --> 00:05:59.490
It was here...

22
00:06:00.899 --> 00:06:02.906
when my grandfather
opened this shop...

23
00:06:03.715 --> 00:06:04.795
hundred years ago.

24
00:06:06.915 --> 00:06:09.501
He waited for a man
to come to pick it up...

25
00:06:11.299 --> 00:06:12.924
return to rightful owner.

26
00:06:15.203 --> 00:06:16.348
Man never came.

27
00:06:17.795 --> 00:06:19.486
My father take over the shop.

28
00:06:20.067 --> 00:06:22.653
Waited. too. Long time.

29
00:06:22.723 --> 00:06:23.671
Now me.

30
00:06:24.547 --> 00:06:26.434
That's a Northern Temple-style
bo staff.

31
00:06:27.331 --> 00:06:29.819
Same kind the thirteen monks used
to save the Tang Emperor.

32
00:06:29.891 --> 00:06:31.135
I've seen it before.

33
00:06:32.387 --> 00:06:33.467
That exact one.

34
00:06:34.019 --> 00:06:35.394
I've had dreams about it.

35
00:06:35.459 --> 00:06:36.407
You know why?

36
00:06:37.187 --> 00:06:39.075
You watch
too much <i>Hong Kong Phooey.</i>

37
00:06:39.139 --> 00:06:40.066
Come.

38
00:06:40.419 --> 00:06:41.368
Come on.

39
00:06:42.691 --> 00:06:45.538
I give you
five awesome Bruce Lee movie...

40
00:06:46.915 --> 00:06:48.475
for very sick price.

41
00:06:48.547 --> 00:06:50.074
You're the man. Hop.

42
00:07:02.724 --> 00:07:03.672
Jason!

43
00:07:04.803 --> 00:07:06.777
Hey. What's up?

44
00:07:06.851 --> 00:07:08.990
Not much.
Just. you know. cruisin'.

45
00:07:09.059 --> 00:07:10.139
You been down to Chinatown.

46
00:07:10.211 --> 00:07:11.291
What's up with that?

47
00:07:12.739 --> 00:07:13.666
Kung-fu.

48
00:07:13.731 --> 00:07:14.659
Are you serious?

49
00:07:14.723 --> 00:07:16.097
I'm not supposed
to talk about it...

50
00:07:16.163 --> 00:07:17.440
not under the kung-fu code.

51
00:07:17.507 --> 00:07:20.856
Hey. look. The new kid's
makin' time with the hoodsies.

52
00:07:21.572 --> 00:07:23.775
J-boy. you still riding
this loser cruiser?

53
00:07:23.843 --> 00:07:25.469
You need to get a motor
for this shit.

54
00:07:26.563 --> 00:07:27.774
What we got here?

55
00:07:27.843 --> 00:07:29.697
Just some bootlegs. no big deal.

56
00:07:29.763 --> 00:07:30.875
<i>"Enter the Dragon"?</i>

57
00:07:32.387 --> 00:07:33.369
<i>"The Bride With White Hair"?</i>

58
00:07:33.443 --> 00:07:35.232
Yeah. that's actually very good.

59
00:07:37.763 --> 00:07:39.072
Come on. let him go.

60
00:07:39.139 --> 00:07:40.863
Yeah. don't. He knows kung-fu.

61
00:07:40.931 --> 00:07:42.108
What?

62
00:07:42.179 --> 00:07:43.292
You think you're Chinese?

63
00:07:43.363 --> 00:07:45.021
You hangin' out
with them Chinks in C-town?

64
00:07:46.211 --> 00:07:47.673
What's up with you?
Let's see some. man.

65
00:07:47.747 --> 00:07:48.674
Come on.

66
00:07:49.283 --> 00:07:50.657
Let's see some kung-fu. huh?

67
00:07:50.723 --> 00:07:51.672
Kung-fu master.

68
00:07:53.347 --> 00:07:55.071
Want some tae kwon do. huh?

69
00:08:00.195 --> 00:08:01.242
Yo. Lupo.

70
00:08:01.315 --> 00:08:03.225
He's hangin' out with that
old Chink cashes checks.

71
00:08:07.747 --> 00:08:09.373
You in tight with the old man?

72
00:08:13.763 --> 00:08:14.876
Just shut up and do it!

73
00:08:19.651 --> 00:08:21.309
It's late. man.
He's probably gone home.

74
00:08:28.483 --> 00:08:29.890
He's not here. Let's just go.

75
00:08:29.955 --> 00:08:31.133
Who's there?

76
00:08:32.547 --> 00:08:33.627
Kung-fu boy.

77
00:08:34.531 --> 00:08:36.419
You back
for more good-price movie?

78
00:08:43.939 --> 00:08:46.721
I told you.
best deal in Chinatown.

79
00:08:46.787 --> 00:08:47.932
Come in.

80
00:08:49.827 --> 00:08:50.972
Want some tea?

81
00:08:52.163 --> 00:08:53.472
Red Sox game is on.

82
00:08:55.459 --> 00:08:57.281
Yankees winning. Very bad.

83
00:09:01.763 --> 00:09:03.192
Who's with you?

84
00:09:03.267 --> 00:09:04.249
Friend?

85
00:09:04.323 --> 00:09:05.730
Where you keep the cash?

86
00:09:11.843 --> 00:09:13.337
I said.
where do you keep the cash?

87
00:09:13.411 --> 00:09:14.818
- Please...
- Come on. old man!

88
00:09:16.419 --> 00:09:17.467
Stay here!

89
00:09:35.779 --> 00:09:36.924
Found your Xbox.

90
00:09:43.075 --> 00:09:44.023
Hop!

91
00:09:45.059 --> 00:09:45.987
Jesus. Lupo!

92
00:09:46.051 --> 00:09:47.393
- What the hell. man?
- You shot him!

93
00:09:47.459 --> 00:09:48.407
Take it.

94
00:09:49.603 --> 00:09:51.742
Must return to rightful owner.

95
00:09:52.419 --> 00:09:53.401
Run.

96
00:09:55.426 --> 00:09:56.375
You didn't see that. yo.

97
00:09:57.571 --> 00:09:58.651
You didn't see that!

98
00:10:09.315 --> 00:10:10.722
Come here. you little shit!

99
00:10:20.483 --> 00:10:22.044
Lupo. come on. man! Just don't...

100
00:10:22.115 --> 00:10:23.544
- You didn't see nothing!
- Calm down. Lupo.

101
00:10:23.619 --> 00:10:24.634
Hey. chill. man. Come on.

102
00:10:24.707 --> 00:10:25.951
- Put the gun down.
- Shut up!

103
00:10:26.019 --> 00:10:28.702
Maybe I pulled the trigger.
but we're all in this together!

104
00:10:29.282 --> 00:10:31.322
But this little cockroach.
he ain't one of us!

105
00:11:43.587 --> 00:11:44.535
Excuse me.

106
00:11:44.611 --> 00:11:45.789
I don't know where I am.

107
00:11:46.434 --> 00:11:47.841
I don't know how I got here.

108
00:11:47.907 --> 00:11:49.335
I remember falling.

109
00:13:10.562 --> 00:13:11.806
What? This?

110
00:13:12.515 --> 00:13:13.463
You want this?

111
00:13:58.659 --> 00:13:59.869
I don't know what you're saying.

112
00:14:02.979 --> 00:14:05.280
I can't understand you!

113
00:14:08.514 --> 00:14:10.336
That's because
you're not listening!

114
00:14:12.803 --> 00:14:13.752
Behind you!

115
00:14:46.435 --> 00:14:47.515
I don't know where I am...

116
00:14:48.675 --> 00:14:49.602
or how I got here...

117
00:14:49.667 --> 00:14:51.128
and who those guys were
that wanted to kill me.

118
00:14:51.907 --> 00:14:53.794
But whatever you did back there
was sick.

119
00:14:53.859 --> 00:14:56.193
No. Drunken Fist.

120
00:14:57.347 --> 00:14:59.070
Secret kung-fu of the South.

121
00:15:00.002 --> 00:15:02.523
I'm Lu Yan. traveling scholar.

122
00:15:03.971 --> 00:15:05.694
What land do you come from. monk?

123
00:15:05.762 --> 00:15:06.940
I'm not a monk.

124
00:15:07.971 --> 00:15:09.149
I'm Jason.

125
00:15:09.219 --> 00:15:11.422
Jason Tripitikas.
from South Boston.

126
00:15:13.602 --> 00:15:14.747
Is this a dream?

127
00:15:14.818 --> 00:15:16.379
No.

128
00:15:16.451 --> 00:15:18.655
Where you came from
is the dream...

129
00:15:19.266 --> 00:15:21.121
through the Gate of No Gate.

130
00:15:22.146 --> 00:15:24.699
Is that like a wormhole
or something?

131
00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.105
No. It means
you are either a Zen master...

132
00:15:28.354 --> 00:15:30.296
or you carry something
very special.

133
00:15:30.786 --> 00:15:32.096
This?

134
00:15:32.163 --> 00:15:34.301
It was in a pawn shop. waiting
for a man to pick it up...

135
00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:37.687
and return it
to its rightful owner.

136
00:15:38.818 --> 00:15:39.931
What?

137
00:15:40.994 --> 00:15:42.304
It's long been foretold...

138
00:15:43.395 --> 00:15:44.704
that a seeker will come...

139
00:15:45.571 --> 00:15:49.979
to return the staff and end
the reign of the Jade Warlord.

140
00:15:50.659 --> 00:15:51.903
Return the staff to who?

141
00:15:52.962 --> 00:15:54.391
The Monkey King.

142
00:15:54.466 --> 00:15:56.157
Born of a stone...

143
00:15:56.706 --> 00:15:59.041
on the mountain of fruit
and flowers.

144
00:15:59.938 --> 00:16:04.128
With his weapon in hand.
his chi became like fire...

145
00:16:04.771 --> 00:16:06.658
his stick fighting like magic.

146
00:16:07.299 --> 00:16:09.088
He defied the order
of the land...

147
00:16:10.051 --> 00:16:12.571
but the Jade Army
could not defeat him.

148
00:16:33.026 --> 00:16:36.125
The Monkey King crushed
every soldier sent to stop him.

149
00:16:36.195 --> 00:16:39.064
With his magical staff.
he was unbeatable.

150
00:16:40.194 --> 00:16:41.787
Word of his disobedience...

151
00:16:41.859 --> 00:16:44.609
traveled deep
within the Forbidden Kingdom...

152
00:16:44.675 --> 00:16:48.090
to the Five Elements Mountain.
land of the immortals.

153
00:16:48.867 --> 00:16:51.136
Once every 500 years...

154
00:16:51.203 --> 00:16:53.756
the Jade Emperor hosts
the Peach Banquet.

155
00:16:53.827 --> 00:16:56.445
It is here.
the heavenly ministers gather...

156
00:16:56.514 --> 00:16:58.554
to celebrate their longevity...

157
00:16:58.627 --> 00:17:00.896
and drink
the elixir of immortality.

158
00:17:02.659 --> 00:17:06.936
One sip of this heavenly brew
will give everlasting life...

159
00:17:07.011 --> 00:17:09.564
free from mortal suffering
and desire.

160
00:17:13.698 --> 00:17:16.895
Into the banquet. the
Monkey King crashed. uninvited.

161
00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:24.545
The Jade Emperor was
enchanted by the Monkey King.

162
00:17:25.474 --> 00:17:27.809
But the Jade Warlord
was not amused.

163
00:17:28.643 --> 00:17:30.203
As master of the army...

164
00:17:30.274 --> 00:17:33.308
the Warlord demanded
the Monkey King bow down to him.

165
00:17:42.498 --> 00:17:45.116
He's a bit unrefined.
that's all.

166
00:17:46.498 --> 00:17:50.110
Give the naughty monkey
a title and let him go.

167
00:17:54.243 --> 00:17:57.177
Satisfied all was well
in heaven and earth...

168
00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:58.712
the supremely high Emperor...

169
00:17:58.786 --> 00:18:01.503
left to begin
his 500 years meditation...

170
00:18:01.571 --> 00:18:05.215
leaving the Jade Warlord
in charge by mandate of heaven.

171
00:18:06.146 --> 00:18:08.186
But rather than obey
the Jade Emperor's command...

172
00:18:08.259 --> 00:18:11.106
the Warlord challenged
the Monkey King to a duel.

173
00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:16.385
High atop Five Elements Mountain
in the Warlord's palace...

174
00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:19.226
the battle of immortals
was fought...

175
00:18:19.298 --> 00:18:22.647
to prove once and for all
whose skills were supreme.

176
00:20:55.106 --> 00:20:58.335
Most excellent stick fighting.
Sun Wukong.

177
00:20:58.402 --> 00:21:01.599
But without your weapon. you're
nothing but a lowly hermit!

178
00:21:02.882 --> 00:21:05.402
No more weapons.
no more chi magic.

179
00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:09.022
Fist against fist.

180
00:21:10.434 --> 00:21:12.289
The Monkey King
was too trusting...

181
00:21:12.354 --> 00:21:14.209
and believed
the Warlord's words...

182
00:21:14.274 --> 00:21:15.835
laying down his magic weapon.

183
00:21:23.298 --> 00:21:26.080
Realizing he'd been tricked. the
Monkey King cast the staff...

184
00:21:26.146 --> 00:21:27.521
out into the Middle Kingdom.

185
00:21:45.154 --> 00:21:47.773
Martial art
is based on deception...

186
00:21:49.059 --> 00:21:50.073
my friend.

187
00:21:56.227 --> 00:21:59.096
Being immortal. the Monkey King
could not be killed...

188
00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:00.763
only trapped in stone...

189
00:22:00.834 --> 00:22:03.005
where he waits for the seeker
from the prophesy...

190
00:22:03.074 --> 00:22:06.457
to return to him his great weapon
and finally free him.

191
00:22:17.347 --> 00:22:18.688
That's what I heard. anyway.

192
00:22:20.962 --> 00:22:22.042
Long time ago.

193
00:22:22.370 --> 00:22:23.482
How long has he been imprisoned?

194
00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:27.352
Five hundred years.
give or take a few decades.

195
00:22:28.226 --> 00:22:30.647
They say
when the Monkey King is free...

196
00:22:30.722 --> 00:22:32.031
the Jade Emperor will return.

197
00:22:34.146 --> 00:22:35.291
How do I get home?

198
00:22:35.362 --> 00:22:38.777
You must return the staff
to Five Elements Mountain.

199
00:22:39.458 --> 00:22:41.368
You must free the Monkey King.

200
00:22:41.442 --> 00:22:42.686
I can't free the Monkey King.

201
00:22:42.754 --> 00:22:43.682
I gotta get home.

202
00:22:43.746 --> 00:22:45.688
Innkeeper! More wine.

203
00:22:46.146 --> 00:22:47.870
Jeez. don't you think
you've had one too many?

204
00:22:49.283 --> 00:22:50.744
Wine is my inspiration.

205
00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:54.013
In some parts.
I am known as the Poet.

206
00:22:54.083 --> 00:22:55.031
<i>Gambei.</i>

207
00:22:58.786 --> 00:23:00.924
In other parts.
I am known as the Beggar.

208
00:23:23.714 --> 00:23:24.641
What do we do now?

209
00:23:24.706 --> 00:23:25.916
How good is your kung-fu?

210
00:23:28.034 --> 00:23:29.561
He who speaks does not know.

211
00:23:29.634 --> 00:23:31.674
He who knows does not speak.

212
00:23:31.746 --> 00:23:33.240
Surely. you are masterful.

213
00:23:40.002 --> 00:23:40.951
Where did you get that weapon?

214
00:23:41.026 --> 00:23:41.953
It's a fake.

215
00:23:42.018 --> 00:23:44.800
You can find anything these days
on the Silk Road.

216
00:23:44.866 --> 00:23:46.076
Out of way. old fool.

217
00:23:49.698 --> 00:23:50.647
Hand it over.

218
00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:55.938
Hand over the weapon... or die.

219
00:24:08.162 --> 00:24:09.110
Go!

220
00:24:41.250 --> 00:24:42.298
Lu. help!

221
00:25:01.346 --> 00:25:02.295
Protect yourself!

222
00:25:02.370 --> 00:25:03.319
What?

223
00:26:14.306 --> 00:26:15.255
Let's go!

224
00:26:31.202 --> 00:26:32.281
Where are you going?

225
00:26:34.594 --> 00:26:35.870
- Jump!
- I don't think so!

226
00:26:35.938 --> 00:26:37.313
Don't think! Just do!

227
00:26:47.682 --> 00:26:48.630
Come on!

228
00:26:58.498 --> 00:26:59.512
Thank you!

229
00:27:07.970 --> 00:27:08.898
Such skills. child!

230
00:27:08.962 --> 00:27:10.784
Are you
from northern mountains?

231
00:27:10.850 --> 00:27:12.705
She is Golden Sparrow.
from the south.

232
00:28:06.338 --> 00:28:07.745
You really saved
our lives back there.

233
00:28:08.513 --> 00:28:09.441
I don't know
what we would have done...

234
00:28:09.506 --> 00:28:10.455
if you hadn't come along.

235
00:28:10.530 --> 00:28:13.792
She does not think The Drunken
Immortal needed his life saved.

236
00:28:15.106 --> 00:28:16.054
You're immortal?

237
00:28:17.250 --> 00:28:18.974
What do you run from. child?

238
00:28:19.202 --> 00:28:21.274
Bounty hunters
trying to stop her...

239
00:28:21.345 --> 00:28:23.734
from reaching
the Five Elements Mountain.

240
00:28:29.794 --> 00:28:31.801
I suggest
you keep riding west...

241
00:28:31.874 --> 00:28:33.914
and only stop
to water your horses.

242
00:28:33.986 --> 00:28:35.033
You're not coming?

243
00:28:35.106 --> 00:28:36.960
The journey
to Five Elements Mountain...

244
00:28:37.026 --> 00:28:38.619
crosses barrens and deserts.

245
00:28:38.690 --> 00:28:39.835
Unspeakable dangers.

246
00:28:39.906 --> 00:28:41.596
Worst of all. no wine.

247
00:28:41.665 --> 00:28:42.909
His elixir.

248
00:28:42.977 --> 00:28:44.352
Every immortal has one.

249
00:28:44.418 --> 00:28:46.687
I'm very sorry.
Without wine. I would perish.

250
00:28:46.754 --> 00:28:47.703
You must understand this.

251
00:28:48.481 --> 00:28:51.165
No. You must understand this.

252
00:28:51.234 --> 00:28:52.216
This is insane!

253
00:28:53.570 --> 00:28:55.130
- You wish to get home?
- Yes.

254
00:28:57.602 --> 00:28:58.682
Then listen well!

255
00:28:58.754 --> 00:28:59.681
If you die here...

256
00:28:59.745 --> 00:29:01.818
you'll be found dead
in the world you left behind.

257
00:29:02.370 --> 00:29:03.352
Do you understand?

258
00:29:06.178 --> 00:29:08.065
My jug is getting low.

259
00:29:08.130 --> 00:29:09.407
I must say goodbye. Bye-bye.

260
00:29:18.434 --> 00:29:19.416
Lu.

261
00:29:19.874 --> 00:29:20.822
Wait!

262
00:29:21.377 --> 00:29:22.359
Let him go.

263
00:29:22.433 --> 00:29:25.335
You are the one
to return the staff. not him.

264
00:29:26.529 --> 00:29:28.188
How good is your kung-fu?

265
00:29:28.258 --> 00:29:29.883
He's got no kung-fu.

266
00:29:29.954 --> 00:29:31.198
None!

267
00:29:31.266 --> 00:29:32.411
Lu. wait!

268
00:29:32.930 --> 00:29:34.075
Teach me.

269
00:29:34.817 --> 00:29:36.246
Teach me to fight!

270
00:29:45.729 --> 00:29:47.256
Swing soft. cut hard!

271
00:29:47.330 --> 00:29:48.475
At the same time!

272
00:29:50.146 --> 00:29:51.160
He's terrible.

273
00:29:55.810 --> 00:29:57.665
I've been your weed-whacker
for two days now...

274
00:29:58.242 --> 00:30:00.730
while you sit on your horse
like the King of England.

275
00:30:00.802 --> 00:30:02.111
When are you gonna
teach me kung-fu?

276
00:30:02.178 --> 00:30:04.633
- You want to learn kung-fu?
- Yeah.

277
00:30:08.769 --> 00:30:10.176
I teach you kung-fu.

278
00:30:13.538 --> 00:30:14.465
That's called strike.

279
00:30:14.529 --> 00:30:15.740
Tomorrow. I'll teach you block.

280
00:30:16.290 --> 00:30:17.305
Let's go.

281
00:30:18.498 --> 00:30:20.832
Swing soft. cut hard.

282
00:30:40.994 --> 00:30:42.903
You think you'll teach me
the No Shadow Kick?

283
00:30:44.866 --> 00:30:46.688
And the Buddha Palm Technique?

284
00:30:49.345 --> 00:30:50.687
There's a guy
in <i>Virtual Fighter 2...</i>

285
00:30:51.458 --> 00:30:52.832
that does
the Buddha Palm technique.

286
00:30:52.898 --> 00:30:54.207
Thanks. Lu.

287
00:30:54.274 --> 00:30:55.518
And he does the...

288
00:30:56.962 --> 00:30:57.911
the Iron Elbow...

289
00:30:58.914 --> 00:31:01.052
and he does
the One-Fingered Death Touch.

290
00:31:01.121 --> 00:31:02.136
The cup's full.

291
00:31:02.210 --> 00:31:03.322
Stop! It's full.

292
00:31:04.738 --> 00:31:05.785
Exactly.

293
00:31:06.562 --> 00:31:08.504
How can you fill your cup
if already full?

294
00:31:09.409 --> 00:31:11.068
How can you learn kung-fu?

295
00:31:11.138 --> 00:31:12.698
You already know so much.

296
00:31:13.441 --> 00:31:15.165
No Shadow Kick. Buddha Palm!

297
00:31:16.194 --> 00:31:17.404
Empty your cup.

298
00:31:22.849 --> 00:31:24.256
Hopeless.

299
00:31:24.322 --> 00:31:25.401
It is hopeless.

300
00:31:46.145 --> 00:31:47.640
It is said that music...

301
00:31:48.930 --> 00:31:52.410
is a bridge
between earth and heaven.

302
00:31:53.634 --> 00:31:54.714
It's beautiful.

303
00:32:01.505 --> 00:32:02.912
It belonged to her mother.

304
00:34:01.986 --> 00:34:03.000
Lu Yan?

305
00:34:19.810 --> 00:34:20.889
Sparrow!

306
00:35:04.609 --> 00:35:05.624
Are you all right?

307
00:35:05.698 --> 00:35:06.625
Jason. what happened?

308
00:35:06.689 --> 00:35:08.697
He took it! The staff!

309
00:35:10.977 --> 00:35:13.050
The Jade Warlord
has sent a bounty hunter.

310
00:35:13.857 --> 00:35:15.134
We are doomed.

311
00:35:26.625 --> 00:35:27.737
That's his horse.

312
00:35:27.809 --> 00:35:28.758
He must be inside.

313
00:35:29.858 --> 00:35:32.313
Why would he take refuge
in a temple?

314
00:35:32.385 --> 00:35:33.595
That's what I intend
to find out.

315
00:35:34.305 --> 00:35:35.385
Wait with the horses.

316
00:36:05.793 --> 00:36:07.135
Good to get off my feet.

317
00:36:08.897 --> 00:36:09.846
Long day.

318
00:36:11.201 --> 00:36:13.143
So. where are you from?

319
00:36:13.217 --> 00:36:14.362
Shandong Province?

320
00:36:15.938 --> 00:36:18.491
You look like
the Shandong Province type.

321
00:36:18.562 --> 00:36:19.739
You come here often?

322
00:36:22.146 --> 00:36:24.055
That staff
doesn't belong to you.

323
00:36:27.458 --> 00:36:29.978
You have to give it to me.
or somebody might get hurt.

324
00:37:47.234 --> 00:37:48.695
What kind of monk are you?

325
00:37:49.921 --> 00:37:51.546
Stealing from travelers.

326
00:37:54.818 --> 00:37:56.378
A silent one. I see.

327
00:37:58.017 --> 00:37:58.966
Or deaf.

328
00:38:01.185 --> 00:38:02.646
I'm speaking to you. monk!

329
00:39:38.209 --> 00:39:39.485
Praying Mantis.

330
00:39:39.554 --> 00:39:40.764
Very good...

331
00:39:40.833 --> 00:39:42.294
for catching bugs.

332
00:39:42.369 --> 00:39:43.547
But not tiger!

333
00:41:35.969 --> 00:41:38.239
You tried to steal the staff
for the Warlord!

334
00:41:38.305 --> 00:41:39.352
No. fool!

335
00:41:41.857 --> 00:41:44.475
I'm on a mission to find
the seeker of the staff.

336
00:42:02.945 --> 00:42:04.222
You found him.

337
00:43:18.017 --> 00:43:19.544
How long have you been searching
for the staff?

338
00:43:20.353 --> 00:43:21.979
As long as I can remember.

339
00:44:32.160 --> 00:44:33.622
Jason. go deeper!

340
00:44:34.049 --> 00:44:36.350
Must taste bitter before sweet.

341
00:44:36.417 --> 00:44:37.943
Horse stance. Grow roots.

342
00:44:50.144 --> 00:44:51.093
Horse stance.

343
00:44:52.641 --> 00:44:55.423
Very good... for taking a dump.

344
00:44:58.593 --> 00:44:59.738
Enough from you!

345
00:44:59.809 --> 00:45:01.980
He's my student. not yours!

346
00:45:02.049 --> 00:45:05.082
Two tigers cannot live
on the same mountain.

347
00:45:05.152 --> 00:45:07.454
Two masters cannot teach
the same student!

348
00:45:12.480 --> 00:45:15.230
If he is really to learn
the kung-fu...

349
00:45:15.297 --> 00:45:18.199
he must develop speed.
accuracy. and power.

350
00:45:18.561 --> 00:45:20.416
Hey! I know that.

351
00:45:20.961 --> 00:45:22.619
It's the Way
of the Intercepting Fist.

352
00:45:22.688 --> 00:45:23.637
Bruce Lee?

353
00:45:30.817 --> 00:45:32.094
I will punch.

354
00:45:32.161 --> 00:45:33.371
You block.

355
00:45:33.441 --> 00:45:34.390
Ready?

356
00:45:37.921 --> 00:45:39.644
What did I teach you
about the Snake?

357
00:45:40.801 --> 00:45:42.045
Now you punch me.

358
00:45:44.801 --> 00:45:45.750
See?

359
00:45:48.321 --> 00:45:49.630
Again. You punch him again.

360
00:45:49.697 --> 00:45:50.645
Snake!

361
00:45:53.857 --> 00:45:55.286
He's not ready for Snake.

362
00:45:55.361 --> 00:45:56.605
Perhaps Eagle.

363
00:45:57.121 --> 00:45:58.681
Crane! Crane!

364
00:46:10.784 --> 00:46:12.475
Stop!

365
00:46:12.545 --> 00:46:13.822
I've had enough!

366
00:46:13.953 --> 00:46:15.262
No more!

367
00:46:15.329 --> 00:46:16.922
No more silent riddles!

368
00:46:17.985 --> 00:46:19.261
And no more empty cups!

369
00:46:24.032 --> 00:46:26.269
First. you show respect
to your teachers!

370
00:46:29.089 --> 00:46:32.252
So. what about the two tigers
on one mountain?

371
00:46:33.761 --> 00:46:35.550
We can kill each other
when it's over.

372
00:46:46.017 --> 00:46:47.326
Kung-fu.

373
00:46:47.393 --> 00:46:49.946
Hard work over time
to accomplish skill.

374
00:46:54.944 --> 00:46:57.279
A painter can hace kung-fu.

375
00:46:57.345 --> 00:47:01.469
Or the butcher who cuts meat
every day with such skill...

376
00:47:01.537 --> 00:47:03.773
his knife never touches bone.

377
00:47:08.161 --> 00:47:11.128
Learn the form.
but seek the formless.

378
00:47:12.128 --> 00:47:13.503
Hear the soundless.

379
00:47:14.113 --> 00:47:17.757
Learn it all.
then forget it all.

380
00:47:17.825 --> 00:47:21.818
Learn The Way.
then find your own way.

381
00:47:22.721 --> 00:47:24.892
The musician can hace kung-fu...

382
00:47:24.960 --> 00:47:27.808
or the poet who paints pictures
with words...

383
00:47:27.873 --> 00:47:29.815
and makes emperors weep.

384
00:47:29.889 --> 00:47:31.612
This. too. is kung-fu.

385
00:47:32.481 --> 00:47:36.671
But do not name it. my friend.
for it is like water.

386
00:47:36.736 --> 00:47:38.973
Nothing is softer than water...

387
00:47:39.041 --> 00:47:41.724
yet it can overcome rock.

388
00:47:41.792 --> 00:47:43.451
It does not fight.

389
00:47:43.521 --> 00:47:46.335
It flows around the opponent.

390
00:47:46.401 --> 00:47:48.189
Formless. nameless...

391
00:47:48.256 --> 00:47:51.518
the true master dwells within.

392
00:47:51.584 --> 00:47:53.591
Only you can free him.

393
00:48:54.656 --> 00:48:56.958
Behold the tyranny
of the Warlord.

394
00:48:57.984 --> 00:48:59.478
He must be stopped.

395
00:49:00.097 --> 00:49:03.413
He must be killed for his crimes
and his head put on a post.

396
00:49:04.704 --> 00:49:08.185
But we must not feel hatred
towards him. or he wins.

397
00:49:10.720 --> 00:49:12.892
If he speaks of compassion
for this devil...

398
00:49:13.889 --> 00:49:15.864
he should go back to his temple
and pray.

399
00:49:16.736 --> 00:49:19.933
Our mission is not one of peace.

400
00:49:20.001 --> 00:49:21.910
Go back
to your mother and father.

401
00:49:22.944 --> 00:49:24.253
You are but a child.

402
00:49:25.216 --> 00:49:26.165
They are dead.

403
00:49:28.417 --> 00:49:30.140
And she's not a child.

404
00:49:32.448 --> 00:49:33.659
Not anymore.

405
00:49:36.128 --> 00:49:37.077
Her father...

406
00:49:37.985 --> 00:49:41.597
was a government official
who opposed the Warlord.

407
00:49:43.360 --> 00:49:46.142
And so. to set an example...

408
00:49:46.209 --> 00:49:49.143
the Warlord dispatched
his troops into the night.

409
00:49:54.112 --> 00:49:58.236
Legion upon legion poured out
of the Five Elements Mountain...

410
00:49:58.304 --> 00:50:00.606
into the lowlands
of the Middle Kingdom.

411
00:50:02.625 --> 00:50:05.941
Screams of innocent people
hung in the night air.

412
00:50:09.184 --> 00:50:13.341
When it was over. charred ruins
were all that remained.

413
00:50:14.496 --> 00:50:18.326
That. and a lonely child. hidden
in the well by her mother...

414
00:50:19.648 --> 00:50:21.404
ruthlessly murdered
by an arrow...

415
00:50:24.128 --> 00:50:26.016
from the Warlord's bow.

416
00:50:31.264 --> 00:50:34.264
When she reaches
the Warlord's palace...

417
00:50:35.712 --> 00:50:38.331
she will
not offer him forgiveness...

418
00:50:39.361 --> 00:50:40.440
monk.

419
00:50:41.345 --> 00:50:42.589
She will offer him...

420
00:50:43.392 --> 00:50:44.440
this...

421
00:50:50.464 --> 00:50:52.090
a jade dart...

422
00:50:52.161 --> 00:50:54.266
that can kill an immortal.

423
00:50:55.616 --> 00:50:57.721
Long has she practiced.

424
00:51:02.753 --> 00:51:05.851
Vengeance has a way
of rebounding upon oneself.

425
00:51:11.713 --> 00:51:13.207
Master of sensitivity.

426
00:51:54.944 --> 00:51:56.286
Damn.

427
00:51:56.352 --> 00:51:57.432
This desert is hot.

428
00:51:59.392 --> 00:52:00.734
This is not a desert.

429
00:52:01.729 --> 00:52:03.638
That is the desert!

430
00:52:08.512 --> 00:52:10.072
I hope you know
where you're going!

431
00:52:10.560 --> 00:52:11.575
Crazy monk.

432
00:53:26.113 --> 00:53:27.323
A monk on a mission.

433
00:53:28.192 --> 00:53:29.599
And where does he lead us?

434
00:53:29.664 --> 00:53:31.639
Across a desert to nowhere.

435
00:53:56.864 --> 00:53:58.293
We're not going to make it.
are we?

436
00:54:02.560 --> 00:54:04.699
And even if we do. we still
have to face the Jade Army.

437
00:54:08.192 --> 00:54:09.534
What if I can't handle it?

438
00:54:15.872 --> 00:54:16.887
What if I freeze?

439
00:54:22.145 --> 00:54:23.639
Don't forget to breathe.

440
00:54:56.160 --> 00:54:59.837
If we don't find water soon.
we will perish.

441
00:55:01.920 --> 00:55:05.532
Perhaps a Taoist immortal
can make rain.

442
00:55:07.680 --> 00:55:10.942
If he truly is
a Taoist immortal.

443
00:56:33.376 --> 00:56:35.547
You are an insult
to the name of Buddha!

444
00:56:35.616 --> 00:56:36.598
Blasphemy!

445
00:56:40.096 --> 00:56:41.044
Look!

446
00:56:42.592 --> 00:56:44.153
I lead you to the mountain!

447
00:56:46.304 --> 00:56:47.449
Out there!

448
00:57:54.240 --> 00:57:55.189
Can you see them...

449
00:57:56.288 --> 00:57:57.270
in the clouds?

450
00:57:58.368 --> 00:57:59.644
A two-headed lion.

451
00:58:01.056 --> 00:58:02.038
Right there.

452
00:58:02.624 --> 00:58:03.551
See?

453
00:58:05.024 --> 00:58:05.972
Yeah. I see.

454
00:58:08.032 --> 00:58:08.959
See that one?

455
00:58:09.024 --> 00:58:10.234
Right there.
coming up behind it?

456
00:58:11.296 --> 00:58:12.244
Like a wave?

457
00:58:13.920 --> 00:58:15.164
Looks like the Green Monster.

458
00:58:16.224 --> 00:58:17.435
Green monster?

459
00:58:18.048 --> 00:58:19.063
You mean dragon.

460
00:58:20.320 --> 00:58:21.727
No. I mean Fenway Park.

461
00:58:22.848 --> 00:58:24.703
They call the left field fence
the Green Monster.

462
00:58:26.112 --> 00:58:27.290
It's true.

463
00:58:30.336 --> 00:58:32.060
It does kind of look like
a dragon. though. doesn't it?

464
00:58:36.800 --> 00:58:40.477
Have you family
back in this land you come from?

465
00:58:42.752 --> 00:58:43.701
My mother.

466
00:58:44.800 --> 00:58:45.748
Father?

467
00:58:47.456 --> 00:58:48.471
Never knew him.

468
00:58:50.752 --> 00:58:52.312
Do you ever long for him?

469
00:58:54.464 --> 00:58:55.838
Wonder who he was?

470
00:58:59.200 --> 00:59:01.883
Maybe the only thing
I've ever been good at...

471
00:59:03.904 --> 00:59:05.016
pretending that I don't.

472
00:59:08.288 --> 00:59:09.498
She is sorry.

473
00:59:14.080 --> 00:59:16.055
How romantic.

474
00:59:18.080 --> 00:59:21.179
Men will tell you
what you want to hear. Sparrow.

475
00:59:21.248 --> 00:59:24.826
But in the end. they will
leave you with nothing.

476
00:59:28.704 --> 00:59:30.744
You survived the River of Sand.

477
00:59:30.816 --> 00:59:32.060
Impressive.

478
00:59:32.736 --> 00:59:33.751
And you. boy...

479
00:59:34.464 --> 00:59:35.990
so far from home.

480
00:59:36.064 --> 00:59:39.064
I can ensure your safe return.

481
00:59:39.136 --> 00:59:40.991
Just bring the weapon forward.

482
00:59:41.056 --> 00:59:42.333
I don't think so.

483
00:59:43.424 --> 00:59:44.668
Why do you want the staff?

484
00:59:46.336 --> 00:59:48.441
When I deliver
the lost weapon...

485
00:59:48.512 --> 00:59:52.221
the Jade Warlord shall grant me
the Elixir of Immortality.

486
00:59:54.208 --> 00:59:56.892
An orphan girl.
a lost traveler...

487
00:59:56.960 --> 00:59:59.993
an old drunk.
and a monk who has failed...

488
01:00:00.064 --> 01:00:02.301
at the same task
for half his life.

489
01:00:04.063 --> 01:00:08.820
Misfits following a misfit
in hopes of rescuing... a misfit.

490
01:00:29.792 --> 01:00:30.806
Kill them.

491
01:02:25.439 --> 01:02:27.578
Lu! You okay?

492
01:02:27.648 --> 01:02:28.892
Just thirsty.

493
01:02:51.040 --> 01:02:52.698
It's okay. He's immortal. right?

494
01:02:53.344 --> 01:02:54.326
I mean. he is. right?

495
01:02:54.400 --> 01:02:56.025
Wine. He needs his wine!

496
01:02:56.096 --> 01:02:57.470
There is nothing we can do.

497
01:02:57.536 --> 01:02:58.463
What are you saying?

498
01:02:58.528 --> 01:02:59.543
We have to do something!

499
01:03:31.839 --> 01:03:35.188
I'm afraid the wound
is too deep.

500
01:03:35.263 --> 01:03:37.205
He will not survive it.

501
01:03:38.303 --> 01:03:39.351
He needs wine.

502
01:03:40.512 --> 01:03:42.749
He's one of the Eight Immortals.

503
01:03:42.816 --> 01:03:44.342
Wine is his elixir. Please.

504
01:03:46.591 --> 01:03:48.347
We will send a walking monk.

505
01:03:49.600 --> 01:03:51.160
Don't you have a running monk?

506
01:04:12.992 --> 01:04:14.268
When I was your age...

507
01:04:15.391 --> 01:04:17.660
I was a scholar-warrior
in training.

508
01:04:19.392 --> 01:04:21.726
My arrow was good.
So. too. my kung-fu.

509
01:04:22.975 --> 01:04:27.929
So I was chosen to take
the civil examinations.

510
01:04:29.312 --> 01:04:31.035
To pass would place me...

511
01:04:32.544 --> 01:04:35.740
in the very short line
of scholar immortals.

512
01:04:39.072 --> 01:04:40.021
I failed.

513
01:04:42.367 --> 01:04:43.512
You're not an immortal?

514
01:04:46.592 --> 01:04:49.691
If one
does not attach himself...

515
01:04:49.760 --> 01:04:51.385
to people and desires...

516
01:04:53.791 --> 01:04:56.158
never shall his heart be broken.

517
01:04:58.335 --> 01:04:59.284
But then...

518
01:05:01.184 --> 01:05:02.907
does he ever truly live?

519
01:05:06.400 --> 01:05:07.993
I would rather die a mortal...

520
01:05:10.207 --> 01:05:11.800
who has cared about someone...

521
01:05:13.791 --> 01:05:15.864
than a man free...

522
01:05:15.936 --> 01:05:17.365
from his own death.

523
01:05:19.455 --> 01:05:21.016
I don't want to lose you.

524
01:05:24.415 --> 01:05:26.008
Forget about me.

525
01:05:28.928 --> 01:05:31.961
There is only one
Elixir of Immortality.

526
01:05:32.031 --> 01:05:35.031
It is
the Emperor's mix of jade...

527
01:05:35.104 --> 01:05:37.144
cinnabar. and salts of mercury.

528
01:05:38.143 --> 01:05:41.623
It is forever stored in
the realm of the Jade Palace...

529
01:05:42.911 --> 01:05:47.167
high in the Jade Firmament.
rarely touched by mortals.

530
01:05:47.232 --> 01:05:50.647
To reach it.
one must take the north road...

531
01:05:50.720 --> 01:05:53.240
and cross the border
of heaven and earth...

532
01:05:54.400 --> 01:05:57.083
only to face the Jade Army.

533
01:05:59.263 --> 01:06:00.245
I'm sorry.

534
01:06:01.312 --> 01:06:03.002
There is no other way.

535
01:06:04.000 --> 01:06:05.593
Yes. there is.

536
01:06:07.103 --> 01:06:09.013
In two nights.
there should be no moon.

537
01:06:09.631 --> 01:06:11.736
We can take the south side
of the fourth peak...

538
01:06:12.384 --> 01:06:13.944
under cover of darkness.

539
01:06:15.231 --> 01:06:16.409
- We have to go now.
- No!

540
01:06:17.440 --> 01:06:18.422
But he's going to die!

541
01:06:20.128 --> 01:06:21.622
We go now. we all die.

542
01:06:26.207 --> 01:06:29.436
There is more at stake.
an entire kingdom.

543
01:06:33.152 --> 01:06:34.777
Your passage home.

544
01:06:37.504 --> 01:06:40.799
We will advance in two nights.
when the moon has ceased.

545
01:06:41.503 --> 01:06:42.583
So be it!

546
01:07:27.968 --> 01:07:29.015
When she met you...

547
01:07:30.015 --> 01:07:32.885
long ago in a tea house...

548
01:07:33.888 --> 01:07:35.830
you were a lost boy
and frightened.

549
01:07:39.296 --> 01:07:41.368
Not the kind
she would stand and fight with.

550
01:09:32.320 --> 01:09:34.741
You've made
a most excellent judgment.

551
01:09:51.936 --> 01:09:53.823
The seeker from the prophecy.

552
01:09:54.943 --> 01:09:57.016
Not quite what I expected.

553
01:09:57.088 --> 01:10:00.383
A man is dying
back on Song Mountain.

554
01:10:01.183 --> 01:10:02.131
I need the Elixir.

555
01:10:03.487 --> 01:10:06.237
And why should I give it to you?

556
01:10:06.303 --> 01:10:07.830
Because I brought you the staff.

557
01:10:09.183 --> 01:10:12.217
The life of your friend
for the power to rule a kingdom?

558
01:10:13.311 --> 01:10:15.067
A most reasonable offer.

559
01:10:15.999 --> 01:10:18.749
This man. a good friend?

560
01:10:19.903 --> 01:10:21.365
And a good teacher.

561
01:10:21.440 --> 01:10:24.506
The man who honors his teacher
honors himself.

562
01:10:25.791 --> 01:10:30.395
However. there is a bit
of a problem with your request.

563
01:10:31.136 --> 01:10:32.281
You see...

564
01:10:32.863 --> 01:10:35.863
I've promised the Elixir
to someone else.

565
01:10:36.607 --> 01:10:38.396
But she
didn't bring you the staff.

566
01:10:38.464 --> 01:10:39.412
I did.

567
01:10:40.255 --> 01:10:41.815
The boy has a point.

568
01:10:44.863 --> 01:10:47.384
My Liege. you made a promise.

569
01:10:48.287 --> 01:10:51.189
There is but one way
to resolve such matters.

570
01:10:52.127 --> 01:10:55.094
A martial challenge...
to the death.

571
01:10:57.791 --> 01:10:58.936
With pleasure.

572
01:11:15.263 --> 01:11:17.150
The Elixir of Immortality.

573
01:11:21.535 --> 01:11:24.535
The prize goes to the winner.

574
01:13:44.319 --> 01:13:45.267
Enough!

575
01:14:00.895 --> 01:14:02.651
The seeker from the prophecy.

576
01:14:03.456 --> 01:14:05.278
I find that quite amusing.

577
01:14:06.719 --> 01:14:10.014
Did you really think. even for
a minute. you stood a chance?

578
01:14:13.408 --> 01:14:14.968
I didn't think so.

579
01:15:10.655 --> 01:15:12.543
She will kill you. witch!

580
01:15:12.607 --> 01:15:15.225
Not if I kill you first.
orphan bitch!

581
01:17:59.583 --> 01:18:00.531
<i>Gambei!</i>

582
01:18:19.551 --> 01:18:20.663
Remember what I taught you!

583
01:19:16.447 --> 01:19:17.462
The statue!

584
01:19:21.982 --> 01:19:23.030
Use the staff!

585
01:21:02.782 --> 01:21:03.731
My turn!

586
01:22:43.647 --> 01:22:44.595
My Lord.

587
01:22:45.727 --> 01:22:47.003
Who are you?

588
01:22:47.070 --> 01:22:49.885
The youngest daughter
of a family you murdered.

589
01:22:51.678 --> 01:22:53.533
Come drink with me.

590
01:23:12.894 --> 01:23:14.455
No!

591
01:23:18.175 --> 01:23:19.123
Sparrow!

592
01:23:21.534 --> 01:23:23.127
Come on.

593
01:23:23.198 --> 01:23:25.173
Come on.
You're going to be okay.

594
01:24:53.022 --> 01:24:54.451
Jade Warlord?

595
01:24:55.870 --> 01:24:56.819
He's dead.

596
01:25:07.998 --> 01:25:09.787
I thank you.

597
01:26:01.631 --> 01:26:03.125
Is there anything you can do?

598
01:26:05.567 --> 01:26:08.698
Her destiny was written
by her own hand.

599
01:26:10.367 --> 01:26:11.828
I am sorry.

600
01:26:44.927 --> 01:26:45.974
Traveler...

601
01:26:47.103 --> 01:26:49.470
you have come far.
through the Gate of No Gate...

602
01:26:49.535 --> 01:26:52.950
to fulfill the prophecy
of the mortals.

603
01:26:53.022 --> 01:26:55.443
What do you desire. please?

604
01:26:57.215 --> 01:26:58.556
I just want to go home.

605
01:27:00.766 --> 01:27:01.976
Very well.

606
01:27:07.294 --> 01:27:09.367
It is said master and student...

607
01:27:10.462 --> 01:27:12.120
walk the path side-by-side.

608
01:27:12.190 --> 01:27:15.387
They share their destiny until
their paths go separate ways.

609
01:27:22.398 --> 01:27:23.478
I'll never forget you.

610
01:27:24.414 --> 01:27:27.131
I guess that's what being
immortal truly means.

611
01:27:32.606 --> 01:27:34.297
You freed me. traveler.

612
01:27:35.646 --> 01:27:38.068
Now go free yourself.

613
01:29:19.454 --> 01:29:21.625
So what's it gonna be?

614
01:29:26.558 --> 01:29:27.540
You gonna shut up?

615
01:29:35.454 --> 01:29:36.600
Listen. pissant!

616
01:29:36.671 --> 01:29:38.296
I ain't gonna ask you again!

617
01:29:50.590 --> 01:29:52.499
Come on. maggot. get up!
Come on!

618
01:29:54.110 --> 01:29:55.058
You want some more?

619
01:29:57.374 --> 01:29:58.302
Come on.

620
01:30:35.006 --> 01:30:36.216
We don't have to do this.

621
01:31:10.174 --> 01:31:11.897
Take it easy. sir.

622
01:31:11.966 --> 01:31:12.915
You're gonna be fine.

623
01:31:12.990 --> 01:31:15.030
Hop! Hop!

624
01:31:15.102 --> 01:31:16.181
How's he doin'?

625
01:31:16.254 --> 01:31:17.683
It missed his heart.
He'll live.

626
01:31:19.998 --> 01:31:22.137
Of course I'll live.

627
01:31:22.206 --> 01:31:23.668
I'm immortal.

628
01:31:25.918 --> 01:31:28.885
Did you return the staff
to rightful owner?

629
01:31:30.302 --> 01:31:31.230
I did.

630
01:31:32.670 --> 01:31:33.979
You're the man.

631
01:32:12.062 --> 01:32:13.207
Is he gonna be all right?

632
01:32:16.574 --> 01:32:18.330
Looks like it.

633
01:32:18.398 --> 01:32:19.773
I saw what happened.

634
01:32:19.838 --> 01:32:21.082
I work across the street.

635
01:32:22.334 --> 01:32:23.611
You were very brave.

636
01:32:26.494 --> 01:32:27.443
See ya.

637
01:32:31.166 --> 01:32:32.278
Absolutely.

638
01:32:46.718 --> 01:32:48.692
And so the legend is told...

639
01:32:48.766 --> 01:32:51.483
that the Monkey King
began his journey west...

640
01:32:51.550 --> 01:32:52.892
in search of truth...

641
01:32:53.822 --> 01:32:56.211
while the traveler
returned to his world...

642
01:32:56.286 --> 01:33:00.181
to walk the path of the warrior
and find his own truth.

643
01:33:01.022 --> 01:33:02.298
As one tale ends...

644
01:33:03.486 --> 01:33:05.007
so another
begins.

645
01:38:04.981 --> 01:38:05.981
Subtitles by LeapinLar

646
01:38:06.305 --> 01:39:06.543
